# Ignore everything
*

# But not these files...
!.gitignore
!pdf2anki/*
!pdf2anki/text2anki/*
!dist/*
!setup.py
!test.py
!README.md
!LICENSE
!MANIFEST.in
!NOTICE
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!BUILD.md
!CROPPING.md
!JUDGE.md
!DEV_GENANKI_FEATURES.md
!FAQ.md
!tests/*
!SUPERLAZYMODE_PLAN.md
# etc...


# ...even if they are in subdirectories
!*/

# Ignore everything in the .venv directory
.venv/*
pdf2anki/allfiles.txt
allfiles.txt

# --- benchmarks: deny by default, allowlist per reviewed directory -----------
# This repo is PUBLIC. A benchmark run against third-party material (lecture
# slides, exercise sheets, papers) must not reach it -- and that means more than
# the corpus. Rendered pages and OCR results ARE the source material: a
# transcription is the same content in another form, not a neutral measurement
# artifact. The report and the harness leak too: a report names the course and
# its author, and the scripts carry the source filenames and local paths.
# That is not hypothetical -- it is exactly what slipped through once, because
# the `!README.md` and `!*/` rules above match at any depth.
#
# So: nothing under benchmarks/ is versioned unless its directory is listed
# below, after checking where its corpus came from.
benchmarks/**/README.md
benchmarks/**/scripts/*
benchmarks/**/pages/
benchmarks/**/results/
benchmarks/**/logs/
benchmarks/**/corpus/
benchmarks/**/ground_truth.json
benchmarks/**/page_map.json
benchmarks/**/openrouter_models_*.json

# Reviewed: ocr_model_selection/ is drawn from scratch by scripts/make_corpus.py
# -- no third-party material anywhere in it, see its CORPUS.md.
# A directory must be re-included before anything inside it can be.
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/README.md
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/CORPUS.md
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/openrouter_models_*.json
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/scripts/
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/scripts/*
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/corpus/
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/corpus/*
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/pages/
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/pages/*
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/results/
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/results/*
